  "otherLimits": [
    "Original runner file itself, supplied build-json and package-root binaries are not covered by its workspace capture; this review hashes the runner separately.",
    "Workspace capture reuses only the initial paths list, so added files are not discovered at after capture.",
    "Child stdout/stderr output and child runtime have no explicit outer size/time bound; this can hang or exhaust memory but does not turn an ordinary nonzero exit into COMPLETE.",
    "Original runner catches ordinary per-row verifier failures, but spawn/read/capture errors outside try can end before final result.json; this is incomplete evidence rather than an explicit COMPLETE.",
